      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/4341-retract-takeover\n\nResolved by hand:\n- fanuc.cps, doosan-dnm.cps: keep the #4341 retract before the\n  preamble block and main's #4346 G17 G94 words in that block; keep one\n  tcpmLeft declaration (main's #4348) and both comments.\n- The two #4341 test files move into main's directory suites\n  (script_wcs/setup_change, script_rotary/upright_after_tilt).\n- Recorded programs: main's text; they are regenerated in the next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
