      "message": "fix(post): move the recorded programs to the tool-change retract\n\nThe review of #4371 found a stale recorded Fanuc program and a red\nsuite (multiaxis_deburr_tilthead.nc). Main also added multi-section\nprograms since that review. Each recorded program of the Fanuc, Mazak\nand Doosan DNM posts with a later section is now regenerated:\n\n- a later section gets G91 G28 Z0 before its G90 G17 G94 ... G49 G80\n  block;\n- a section after a tilted section writes G49 (TCPM off), then the\n  lift, then the block, then the upright return (as indexed.nc).\n\nNo other line of a recorded program changes. A scan of each tracked\n.nc found no Fanuc, Mazak or Doosan program with a later G49 G80 block\nand no lift before it. The decision record notes the setup-change case\nand the shared tcpmLeft flag (#4348); assets/posts/AGENTS.md states the\nnew law.\n\nFixes #4341\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
